-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party data (NOT covered by the MIT grant above)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The MIT license above covers the source code in this repository and the
model-generated outputs released with it (agent scanpaths, raw model responses,
baseline answers and derived metrics).

It does NOT cover the third-party data used by this project, which remains
under the licenses and terms set by its original authors:

  * COCO-Search18 human eye-movement data (fixation scanpaths, target boxes,
    responses), by Chen, Yang, Ahn, Samaras, Hoai and Zelinsky
    (Scientific Reports, 2021; Yang et al., CVPR 2020). Use is governed by the
    terms published by the COCO-Search18 authors:
    https://sites.google.com/view/cocosearch/

  * The stimulus images, which come from MS-COCO and are subject to the COCO
    terms of use and to the licenses of the individual Flickr images:
    https://cocodataset.org/#termsofuse

Copies or subsets of these data distributed alongside this project (for
example in the companion Hugging Face dataset) are provided for research
reproducibility only. Anyone using them must comply with, and cite, the
original sources.
